      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 162,
        "name": "「自由」的哲学",
        "desc": "天赋培养素材。<br/>风之国土的精神是自由。<br/>自由其三，是歌唱的自由，即是能在风之神塑造的美好土地上歌唱，让自己的心与歌一同随风而去的自由。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Philosophies of Freedom_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9504,
        "name": "亮闪闪的漂流物",
        "desc": "随海浪漂流而来的贝类壳体，明亮而绚丽，氤氲着大海的气息。<br>在「盛夏！海岛？大冒险！」期间，可以换取珍贵的宝物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/03/09/4b7162c4727eb05b5525329edad12850_3093858669615177783.png",
        "amount": 50,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "2",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 109,
        "name": "「抗争」的哲学",
        "desc": "天赋培养素材。<br/>风之国土的脊梁是抗争。<br/>蒙德的历史即是抗争的历史。抗争是为了蒙德未来的诗文，也能自由地随着眷顾的风，传到远方。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Philosophies of Resistance_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9504,
        "name": "亮闪闪的漂流物",
        "desc": "随海浪漂流而来的贝类壳体，明亮而绚丽，氤氲着大海的气息。<br>在「盛夏！海岛？大冒险！」期间，可以换取珍贵的宝物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/03/09/4b7162c4727eb05b5525329edad12850_3093858669615177783.png",
        "amount": 50,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "2",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 177,
        "name": "「诗文」的哲学",
        "desc": "天赋培养素材。<br/>风之国土的灵魂是诗文。<br/>诗文是传颂的心意。即使一切都将逝去，即使一切都将不再，随风而行的诗歌，仍会将此世间一切美好传遍天空、大地与海洋的一切角落。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Philosophies of Ballad_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9504,
        "name": "亮闪闪的漂流物",
        "desc": "随海浪漂流而来的贝类壳体，明亮而绚丽，氤氲着大海的气息。<br>在「盛夏！海岛？大冒险！」期间，可以换取珍贵的宝物。",
        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/03/09/4b7162c4727eb05b5525329edad12850_3093858669615177783.png",
        "amount": 50,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "2",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 150,
        "name": "「繁荣」的哲学",
        "desc": "天赋培养素材。<br/>岩之国土的追求是繁荣。<br/>繁荣是璃月的过去、现在与未来。在此世间一切国度都无法企及的繁荣，均归于璃月，以及璃月的子女。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Philosophies of Prosperity_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 9504,
        "name": "亮闪闪的漂流物",
