        "iconUrl": "https://act-webstatic.hoyoverse.com/event-static-hoyowiki-admin/2026/03/09/4b7162c4727eb05b5525329edad12850_3093858669615177783.png",
        "amount": 50,
        "displayStyle": "card"
      },
      {
        "type": "RichText",
        "text": "2",
        "alignment": "center"
      },
      {
        "type": "CustomEntry",
        "epId": 74,
        "name": "「勤劳」的哲学",
        "desc": "天赋培养素材。<br/>岩之国土的根基是勤劳。<br/>勤劳即为相信自己，即为相信通过汗水、智慧与力量，在诸神的土地上，人人都可以拥有自己的一席之地。",
        "iconUrl": "https://bbs.hoyolab.com/hoyowiki/picture/object/Philosophies of Diligence_icon.png",
        "displayStyle": "card",
        "menuId": 9
